# 16 overload 30 kW: underspeed warning, engine keeps running
# Python measures the DM1 from the moment speed sags below 1350 rpm (within
# 5 s); here from the load step.
0 start
8 load 30
20 end
expect rpm min ..1350 over 8..20
expect dm1 190/18 within 6 of 8
expect lamp amber with 190/18
expect no trip
expect state RUN at end
